    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40759" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιρροφ-έω</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ρῠφέω</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>swallow besides</i>, ld.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Acut.</u>
				24
			</span></i>; <i>take draughts</i> (of an actor), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				948a2
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιρροφεῖν</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ὕδατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Phoc.</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς κύλικος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					14.5
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅταν τὸ ὕδωρ</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πνίγη, τί ἐπιρροφήσομεν</span>; (cf.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιπίνω</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Archig.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				8.577
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. 
			<i>swallow greedily, gulp down</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Clearch.Com.
				1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἀγαθοῦ δαίμονος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theopomp.Com.
					76
				</span></i>
			.</div>
